  <data>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" width="840" height="24">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false">
        <p>03 · FINDING 1 · 算法可判定性</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="70">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>结论一：重分句的最坏情况可以精确求解，且统计流程 fail-closed</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="142" endX="900" endY="142">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="164" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>证据 A · 算法与暴力求解完全一致</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">两代 DP 对暴力 oracle</span>：独立跨度 additive DP 核对 36,824 个合法划分；一阶相邻跨度 edge-state DP 通过 5,669 系统 + 2,000 随机 + 1,000 退化实例——<span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">全部一致</span>。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">规模上限</span>：300-token、k=3 精确覆盖 14,606,509 个划分，最慢运行 0.81s，远低于 10s 门。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>证据 B · 统计校准在合成 null 上闭合</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">99,980 篇合成 null</span>，post-certificate split-conformal 校准 + 严格 ties + 独立 test 单侧 Clopper–Pearson 审计。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">80 个统计门全过</span>，最大单侧 95% FPR 上界 7.465%，低于 8% Stop 门；raw 阈值不会放大最小化证书的 FPR。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="60" startY="430" endX="900" endY="430">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" width="840" height="56">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">边界</span>：这是合成与软件证据——它证明"<span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">能精确评估</span>"，不证明任何真实系统的鲁棒率。真实 watermarked positive 是否会得到空洞证书，仍需真实系统检验（对应裁决 CR01 / CR02 / CR03：支持）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="506" endX="900" endY="506">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" width="840" height="20">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)">
        <p>来源：certified_resegmentation_preflight1 / pairwise_preflight1 / calibration_preflight1 结论文件</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>结论一回答"能不能精确评估"。两代动态规划与暴力枚举逐项一致，说明算法本身可靠。</p>
      <p>统计部分在 99,980 篇合成 null 上 80 个门全过，最大 FPR 上界 7.465%，低于 8% 停止门。</p>
      <p>所以要强调的是：这证明评估方法本身可判定、可 fail-closed，但还不是真实系统的鲁棒率。</p>
      <p>对应证据裁决是 CR01、CR02、CR03 支持。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
